fonts-ocr-a (1.0-7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Team upload.
  * debian/control
    - add Vcs-* field 
    - set Standards-Version: 4.0.0
    - Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 10)
    - Build-Depends: fontforge-nox, instead of fontforge
  * debian/compat
    - set 10
  * debian/rules
    - simplify it.
  * debian/watch
    - Upstream only ever released one version and the release was single files
      not a versioned tarball, which prevents uscan from doing any checking
      for new versions, so drop it

